Viktor 10.10.2026: «По аутпеинтингу было бы хорошо определять точное положение (позировать) референсного изображения на холсте проэцируемых соотношений сторон в генерируемых картинках, скейлить референс и т.п.»; «И очень хочу, чтобы ты представил это в подобной ереси канваса аутпеинта, инпеинта именно так, как в InvokeAI».

heresy-canvas.js: Canvas… beside Mask… once there is a reference. Each shape's frame (InvokeAI's bounding box) a tab on top, saying how it is painted (from it: the picture covers the frame, image to image at the strength; around: the bare part painted around the picture); the board dotted, the frame's bare part a checkerboard, outside it dimmed; the tools on the left (Move and scale V, Brush B, Eraser E, Hand H or Space), the layers on the right (the inpaint mask, the reference with its opacity on the board), the place in numbers (width, X, Y in the frame's share), Fit, Fill, Centre, Same in all (the picture as large in pixels in the other frames), undo and redo, a wheel to zoom, Alt+wheel the picture's size, arrows to nudge. Done keeps the places with the reference (a new one drops them) and the mask in the form; the places said under the strength, ✕ takes the form off the canvas; Draw sends the picked shapes' places with the mask's options; Again its run's own.

Suite: 652 passed (suite-1346.part: the tabs and their modes for a wide picture, a drag on the board, the width typed, Fill, undo and redo, Same in all, a brush stroke, Done, what Draw sends, ✕).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
